    "detailed_description": "Save Their Souls is a mix of platformer and memory game to play solo or with a friend (local co-op mode).<br><br>Players must be fast and memorize the rescue plan of each level, then, run to save the inhabitants of the occupied apartment. <br><br>Use minimap to recognize stairs location and make the faster way. <br><br>Share the responsability with your partner in co-op mode.<br><br>The destiny of these poor souls lies in your hands!!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Linear level unlock.<br></li><li>Retro style with password saves.<br></li><li>Full of humor.<br></li><li>Up to 2 players, splitscreen.<br></li><li>Keyboard and controller compatible.</li></ul>",
